## 7. Rulebook Enterprise (1000)

Opening 100 · Rapport 80 · Discovery 150 · Qualification 80 · Presentation 120 · Pricing 80 · Objection 200 · Closing 80 · Voice 60 · Compliance 50

Mỗi rule bắt buộc đủ field constitution (ID, Category, Name, Description, Weight, Pass, Fail, Evidence, Timestamp, Root Cause, Coaching, Good/Bad Example, Edge Cases, Confidence, JSON Mapping).

Sau mỗi 50 rule: Duplicate Check · Logic Check · JSON Validation.

