## 8. Quality Gate (bắt buộc sau mỗi Sprint)

Architecture · Logic · Rule Consistency · Evidence · Root Cause · Security · Performance · API · JSON · Database · Docker · Audit · Golden Call · Calibration · Revenue Leak · Memory Graph · Personality · Live Assistant · Test Coverage · Documentation

Còn lỗi → **không dừng** · tự sửa đến khi PASS.

