## 9. Sprint Mode

1 Constitution/Docs/Architecture → 2 Rulebook 1–500 → 3 Rulebook 501–1000 → 4 Dataset Factory → 5 AI Judge + Pragmatics → 6 Root Cause + Coaching → 7 Memory Graph + Personality → 8 Live Assistant + Simulator → 9 Revenue Leak + Dashboard → 10 Testing + Refactor + Final Review

Sau mỗi Sprint: Sprint Report · Risk Report · Technical Debt Report · Quality Report · Next Sprint Plan.

